  "description": "What the design is: A digital collection of 20 high-resolution watercolor-style illustrations featuring a charming assortment of quaint village houses, cozy cottages, historic buildings, and festive storefronts.   Included file formats: High-resolution PNG files (300 DPI) with transparent backgrounds, optimized for digital crafting, professional printing, and cutting machines.   Potential use cases:Physical crafting and scrapbooking using Cricut and Silhouette cutting machines.   Sublimation printing for custom mugs, tumblers, coasters, town-themed drinkware, and homeware blanks.   Print-on-demand (POD) merchandise and commercial physical items for home decor, village lifestyle apparel, and seasonal gifts.   Custom apparel creation for cozy t-shirts, hoodies, aprons, and architectural-themed tote bags.   Village-themed party decor, wall art, greeting cards, and custom sticker designs.",
